  "own_english_semantic_envelope": "And all the waters will be mingled with the waters; the water above the heavens is male, and the water below the earth is female. Exact English punctuation should preserve the relationship between mingling and the male/female explanatory predicates without adding doctrine, flood causation, agency or timing absent here.",
